pooled versus the best single sort, per model:
   Gaussian baseline       -0.026
   Bayesian LASSO          -0.045
   Horseshoe               -0.075
   Regularised horseshoe   -0.034
   [the three sorts partition the SAME stock universe, so the 75
    assets are far from 75 independent bets and a pooled long-short
    can hold offsetting stock-level positions. A pooled Sharpe that
    does not exceed the best single sort is therefore consistent
    with the diversification argument rather than against it.]

